# OpenVPN Access Server (https://meclayt.openvpn.com/):
#   Log in in a browser → download your user profile → save as client.ovpn
#   Or: ./scripts/download-profile.sh (see README)
#
# Other VPNs: provider dashboard → OpenVPN → download .ovpn
#
# Minimal template (your provider will give you remote, certs, and auth):

client
dev tun
proto udp
remote vpn.example.com 1194
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
remote-cert-tls server
verb 3

# auth-user-pass          # uncomment if username/password required
# <ca>
# -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
# ... paste CA from provider ...
# -----END CERTIFICATE-----
# </ca>
